work-graph.json:200:      "remaining": "Public SDK and declared-input capture/embedding, generated native consumers and isolated experimental archive/Swift bridge have scoped host and cross-build evidence. Complete graph discovery and actual build consumption, signed toolchain lock/provenance/final embedding, clean-machine immutable distribution and complete two-platform FieldLog builds remain open. Bridge cross-links do not establish mobile execution. All three hosted jobs pass at24a7437, including bridge debug/release/TSan and public-consumer checks after pinned-compiler repairs. This predates additive identity2/release3 and current validator/material work. Identity2 strict parser/capture/embed passes its fixed owned-snapshot matrix; declared-input checks are not complete build-graph or linked-adapter attestation. Installed material-only binding passes16 tests per mode, exact helper/public opacity checks,53 independent shared grant cases and official iOS/Android module/object compilation. No adapter/session/task/filesystem initialization or signed execution authority; hosted material CI passes at61f34bf; durable coordinator and full graph attestation remain pending. Hosted checkpoints b02b76f and51aafe8 pass all three jobs; the latter includes combined function-cache/native tests and explicit reference checks. Hosted35a9a36 passed GCC fixture/bridge48 per mode/activation113, then found SwiftUI teardown reentrant publication. Scoped repair passes13 presentation tests per Debug/Release plus12 TSan,2 independent probes and mobile module compilation; pinned hosted/current-repair native visible qualification remain pending. Exact reactor diagnostic covers79832 defined bodies with six current control-limit rejects; max control depth379 including function, parameters+locals181 and scalar-arity operand-height67. All150 current bindings audited; reference execution is not owned execution or release qualification. Cache-backed frozen-profile execution and standalone exact34