work-graph.json:636:      "referenceDiagnosticCheckpoint": "The reference-first iOS diagnostic now has accepted source, retained generic compilation and repaired classifier evidence. It starts from the existing plain UIButton and checks focus before one public Tab, preserving the original oracle, targets and timing. All 34 producer and 137 independent host controls pass; root rehashes four frozen handoffs and 79 members. The earlier eight classifier failures and authored-first native failure remain unchanged. No new runtime is selected: an importer binding official results to the fresh selected run, device, method, source and products is still required. Full keyboard, carrier, FieldLog, physical-phone and GA acceptance remain pending. See [the reference diagnostic checkpoint](docs/apple-focus-reference-checkpoint.md).",
work-graph.json:638:      "referenceRuntimeV3PreparationCheckpoint": "The reference-first runtime V3 importer is frozen for independent host review. Root verifies 65 handoff members; retained producer controls pass 111/111 and repair controls pass 25/25. The exact old reviewer replay passes 32/33, preserving the agreed malformed-journal fixture failure rather than accepting invalid records. Real composed auxiliary captures now validate; original products, strict oracle and prior failures remain unchanged. No new native run is selected. See docs/apple-focus-reference-runtime-v3.md and verification/apple-focus-reference-runtime-v3-root-review/producer-binding.json.",
work-graph.json:639:      "referenceRuntimeV3ReviewCheckpoint": "Independent host review rejects runtime V3 for native dispatch: 34/37 new controls pass and three raw timestamp precision controls fail. Ambient Decimal precision can round a fractional endpoint forward and accept a later baseline. All 111 producer, 25 repair and 25 composed-inventory controls pass; the old malformed-fixture result remains 32/33. Root verifies 313 review members and the 307-input binding. A separate V4 exact-arithmetic repair is now assigned; no new simulator run is selected. See docs/apple-focus-reference-runtime-v3-independent-review.md and verification/apple-focus-reference-runtime-v3-root-review/independent-decision.json.",
work-graph.json:640:      "referenceRuntimeV4PreparationCheckpoint": "The exact-timestamp V4 importer is frozen for independent host review. Root verifies all 535 handoff members and 621 prior inputs. Producer reports 111 retained, 25 repair, 37 V3-reviewer, 19 precision controls and eight actual-adapter replay cases passing; the historical malformed-fixture result remains 32/33. Fresh independent review is running, so no V4 native run is selected. Source, products, oracle and prior failures remain unchanged. See docs/apple-focus-reference-runtime-v4.md and verification/apple-focus-reference-runtime-v4-root-review/producer-binding.json.",
work-graph.json:641:      "referenceRuntimeV4ReviewCheckpoint": "Independent host review rejects the V4 iOS result importer: 30 of 36 new controls pass and six fail across root timestamp precision, missing archived fixture inputs, Decimal context isolation and incomplete-report schema. Root verifies all 959 review members. A separate V5 repair is running with a closed fixture set and exact canonical timestamps. No new native run is selected. See docs/apple-focus-reference-runtime-v4-independent-review.md and verification/apple-focus-reference-runtime-v4-root-review/independent-decision.json.",
