ions/quarantine/destructors. Default91/combined185 per mode,9 explicit oracles per mode,14 C smoke runs and independent public C races pass; root matched90 inputs/76 implementation logs/2 archive logs/9 review logs. iOS/Android archive and C link checks are compilation only. Exact tested archives are pinned without a bit-reproducibility claim. Strict Swift guest-to-I/O dispatch, scheduler, activation and device qualification remain open. Guest UI checkpoint: bounded SDK42 Debug/Release and19 TSan tests, packaged bridge48 per host mode, signed activation113 per mode, independent repaired-race review, public privacy checks and complete iOS/Android module compilation now pass. Native Apple model12 Debug/Release and11 TSan tests pass; positive display/native click remains pending after occluded probes. Android signed presentation, full Swift execution/size, published consumer and physical/GA gates remain open. Private Swift runtime-control foundation accepted after24 owner and7 independent probes per mode,287 combined+9 reference tests per Debug/Release and563 root evidence bindings. No cache/executor/WASI composition or target execution. Hosted22d048c confirms HTTP/guard repairs but fails later cold-start ordering fixture; d6505ac VM fails another process-wide allocation observer with+4calls/+900bytes, exact origin unknown; Android host step skipped. Repairs underway, no gate changed."
