ete temporary layouts, independent review, executor/target qualification remain pending. Hosted8d809df and bd8a896 all3jobs pass; no external gate is passed. Private Swift cache candidate3 now accepted within bounded synthetic and named-value accounting scope:823root bindings,18named tests perDebug/Release,21explicit terminal latches and315repeated routes per mode,3actual isolated constructor exhaustion cleanups per mode. Construction57224(+96); other phase bounds unchanged. Executor compiling type/lifetime/layout prerequisite assigned; actual executor/full-target/native/device/immutable consumer/GA qualification pending. Hosted01d8491 all3jobs pass. Private executor layout prerequisite and corrected final foundation accepted with2,102root bindings. Additional864bytes raisesfoundation17368; ownerfields/cache additionalenvelopes unchanged. AllsixfeatureD/R and350allfeaturetests/profile pass; ninepreexistingignored/profile remain excluded. Actualexecutorconstruction/algorithms/fulltarget/privateboundedrunner and allnative/release/GA qualifications remain pending. Hosted0f177ad allthreejobs pass, including observed-tick repair underSwift6.2.4. NarrowFrozenMode numericprimitive dispatch accepted360rootbindings; originalowner validation/work/observe/trap literal, noAPI/ownerfield/formulachange. Selected1572hostexecutions+72explicitNodeoracles,4x454publictraces,independent10semantic+4workboundarychecks/profile pass. Typedmax464within512/fixed2912 unchanged. Fullintegration suite notrerun; broadClippy26sameexistingdiagnostics remainsfailure. Complete numericowner/sharedSwiftoperations/fulltarget/physical/FieldLog/GA remainpending."
