work-graph.json:13112:      "remaining": "Durable store has earlier scoped physical recovery receipts. New signed v1/v2 selection into bounded owned VM enforces installed/signed limits, retained state, health and candidate/healthy/native fallback, passing 14 simulator cases plus the earlier 15 adversarial activation cases and three new independent identity-policy tests. Descriptor hashing and full represented host binding pass, but actual build graph capture and signed embedding remain open. Actual compiled feature fallback integration, full Swift/UI/capabilities, physical lifecycle/power-loss, healthy guest quarantine policy, state migration, key rotation and D4-D5 remain open. Additive release3 opaque signature proofs and identity2 metadata integration now pass host/independent review; durable v3 selection, concrete material binding and signed capability execution are still open. Bounded no-instance native validation, exact zero pages and checked typed failures now pass27 owner tests per mode,9 derived probes and22 original public review checks. No transferable proof or signed execution authority is introduced; hosted run39919256699 at09c317c passes all three jobs, including the27-test matrix per mode. Installed material-only binding passes16 tests per mode, exact helper/public opacity checks,53 independent shared grant cases and official iOS/Android module/object compilation. No adapter/session/task/filesystem initialization or signed execution authority; hosted material CI passes at61f34bf; durable coordinator and full graph attestation remain pending. Durable v3 private-owner design is reviewed with immediate terminal failure separate from final drain; metadata-only SPI now passes69 debug/release tests,14 TSan and204 independent external checks, with71 frozen inputs/31 logs/12 retained artifacts audited. Private I/O passes23 tests per host mode,29 independent checks and official iOS/Android compilation against139 frozen inputs. These do not establish committed-health provenance, actor/lifecycle integration or execution authority; the private store, lifecycle and coordinator remain in progress. Concrete lifecycle SPI now passes32 tests per mode,15 derived probes,17 independent public checks per mode,14 labelled internal checks and8 linked consumers; fixed acyclic sinks and exclusive transfer are caller requirements. Pure internal enclosing-evidence policy passes30 tests per debug/release mode and iOS/Android module compilation. No signed execution/health authority is introduced. Hosted lifecycle/policy CI passes at4a413b4. Private counted durable storage passes41 debug/release tests,18 new TSan tests and24 independent probes on frozen3bdf5cd dependencies; both owner-retirement races are fixed. Root audited113 frozen inputs and both evidence seals. Owned worker-boundary enable cutoff passes35 tests per host mode plus independent14 public/28 derived checks per debug/release mode and repaired cross consumers. Fixed attempt latch passes six cases per host mode with source review; actual counted consumer remains pending. CI08e5c2d exposed a test-expression compiler failure;512 byte-parity checks qualify the split and all three hosted jobs atbf5021e now pass, including54 capability-activation tests. The additive signal control-wake seam passes eight cases per debug/release/TSan mode and XCTest typechecking; actual timer/consumer composition remains pending. Private durable transitions now pass79 debug/release functions and25 new TSan functions on frozenbf5021e dependencies, with three privacy negatives, public material client and iOS/Android modules. Root audited122 inputs/116Git inputs/16 logs/295 retained files/nine artifacts and repaired three cold-retry defects; identical probes pass in all three host modes. Closing-only failure recording creates no replacement attempt. Private concrete ownership passes six tests per host mode, nine derived lifecycle checks and six independent executions including join/cancel races and eight real signed/native last-owner-drop cycles per mode. Root reviewed both seals/127 baseline and131 derived inputs/49logs/19artifacts. That scope uses immutable transition candidate2; exact coordinator composition/cross builds, real UI milestones and broader signed activation remain open. Hosted durable-transition checkpointf5d99d1 passes all three jobs. The current signed cold-start coordinator combines 95 functions per Debug/Release/TSan mode, 13 derived functions per mode, two ordinary public consumers, six privacy rejections and official iOS/Android module/object compilation. Root audited 133 frozen inputs, 47 logs, 29 artifacts and 354 retained dependency bindings; four original flow checks pass unchanged in all three modes. Independent review found no actionable defect; two original held health-write/close races pass in all three modes, including144 concurrent close calls. Hosted CI36c5579 passesVM/services but fails Swift6.2.4 on three test-fixture expressions; exact-byte repair passes both fixture variants and six local XCTest functions, with the subsequent ac2d2b6 hosted run confirming the repair. Synthetic milestones and a derived-only invoke driver do not qualify public guest event delivery, real UI health, physical devices or published FieldLog. Hosted run39941366514 at ac2d2b6 now passes all three jobs, including95 capability-activation functions under pinnedSwift6.2.4, confirming the byte-identical fixture repair and signed cold-start composition. Additive guest-UI contract/header and ownership design frozen after55 independent static checks plus C11/C++17 declaration/layout checks, preserving old contract/header bytes. Fixed native validator, bounded SDK exchange, serialized bridge composites and signed native presentation implementation remain next; no UI execution/health authority or gate passed by static definition. Additive native UI validator now passes79 combined/6 focused/49 default tests per host mode,16 C checks per mode and135 independent retained-Release C checks; root audited exact source/evidence. Installed-mode gate passes12 tests per Debug/Release/TSan and rejects capability-only UI opens before pool/filesystem. Current scoped UI implementation evidence is indexed in verification/guest-ui-integration-root-review.json; native visible-screen health, mobile lifecycle and GA qualification remain open. Guest UI checkpoint: bounded SDK42 Debug/Release and19 TSan tests, packaged bridge48 per host mode, signed activation113 per mode, independent repaired-race review, public privacy checks and complete iOS/Android module compilation now pass. Native Apple model12 Debug/Release and11 TSan tests pass; positive display/native click remains pending after occluded probes. Android signed presentation, full Swift execution/size, published consumer and physical/GA gates remain open. A real Mac NSWindow/native-button signed flow now observes revisions1/2/3, private native display health through public snapshots, persisted bytes and joined public close. This uses an original bytecode fixture; fullSwift/FieldLog, iOS/Android lifecycle and physical gates remain open. Hosted5a0367d exposed fixture-only GCC/Swift compiler failures; repair and new CI remain pending.",
