work-graph.json:13355:      "customerArtifactComposition": "Local customer artifact composition accepted after repairs: protected signed upload, staged exact-target private read, v2 actor audit and principal-bound idempotency. Codec: 39 producer and 49 combined independent methods; staged read: 63 producer/regression and 80 combined independent methods; storage: 19 producer and 22 independent methods; facade: 15 producer and 12 independent methods, including actual failed commits for upload/read/audit. Counts overlap. Current-source focused CI passes 97 methods and all seven migrations apply, rerun idempotently, roll back the latest four and reapply. Root verifies 428 retained bindings and 45 current inputs. At artifact checkpoint 6fff5ab9, 132 VM and 40 console bindings were unchanged. All owned PostgreSQL and scratch cleanup passed. Original findings and repairs remain preserved. See docs/hosted-customer-artifact-integration.md and verification/hosted-customer-artifact-root-acceptance/attempt-2/acceptance.json. Customer HTTP/console, tenant trust/lifecycle writers, providers, operations, native, FieldLog and GA remain pending.",
work-graph.json:13356:      "customerArtifactDelivery": "Artifact checkpoint 6fff5ab981f88d7a92c006d20c36f5e963335a9d is pushed to origin/main and remote main was verified. Exactly 2,198 changed paths contain reviewed local customer artifact composition, ordinary CI fixtures, seven-migration integration and retained evidence. Phoenix CI 40195108526 and Engine CI 40195108524 both pass with no skipped steps. See verification/github-delivery-customer-artifacts/delivery-receipt.json and verification/github-ci-6fff5ab9/observation-7/receipt.json. No customer HTTP, provider, native or GA acceptance.",
work-graph.json:13357:      "customerArtifactHTTP": "Local customer HTTP accepted: canonical v3 artifact PUT/GET/HEAD and audit GET/HEAD, exact action scope before body, digest-bound signed upload before transaction, exact retained read bytes and schema-2 audit. Facade: 18 producer and 25 combined independent methods. Transport: 32 producer and 46 combined independent methods. Actual Endpoint/Bandit/default verifier with synthetic TLS JWKS and restricted PostgreSQL: eight methods, 47 requests, zero skips. Counts overlap. Encoded/raw-path aliases were independently reproduced, repaired and retested before body/effects. Root verifies 244 retained bindings and 56 current product inputs; all owned listeners/workers/PostgreSQL/scratch cleaned, 32 console-brand and 132 VM bindings unchanged. See docs/hosted-customer-artifact-http-checkpoint.md. Live console sessions/data, production providers, tenant trust/lifecycle writers, distributed admission, legacy audit/full Go parity, native, FieldLog and GA remain pending.",
work-graph.json:13359:      "customerWorkspace": "Local workspace development slice accepted: identity-only Session and directory-mode isolation; human mixer.workspace.read; SELECT discovery RLS, nullable names, canonical pagination, selected witness/head locks and final commit checks. Real production Endpoint/default verifier/default Repo joins the actual Node console client. Storage passes 24 producer plus 9 independent methods; HTTP passes 22 workspace plus 32 artifact regressions; signed token scope passes 17; real HTTP passes 11 methods covering 65 raw responses plus Node calls; console passes 68 host tests and build, and client independent review passes 21 methods. Counts overlap. Whitespace-ID labels, strict compiler checks and stripped token scope findings are repaired with prior evidence retained. Root acceptance verifies 754 bindings and 98 current product inputs. All owned resources cleaned. The selector follows the website logo/style. App/login/session/browser/CORS/lifecycle/provider/operations/native/FieldLog/GA qualification remains pending. See docs/hosted-customer-workspace-checkpoint.md.",
