work-graph.json:13362:      "customerWorkspaceComposition": "Local console workspace composition accepted: actual /workspace route in website-branded shell, one app-owned controller across routes, exact scoped selection/pagination, immutable responses, cancellation and generation fences. Public reactive reads/actions guard live versus admitted session identity, preventing old-account rows before effects run. Header uses actual matched route. Full console100 host tests/build and14 independent probes pass;4 nested binding methods use real Solid client runtime and HTTP client. Counts overlap. Production entry has no session adapter and remains unavailable. Proposed same-origin login contract passes19 design-model controls only; lifecycle/provider/browser/ingress/native/FieldLog/GA pending. See docs/console-workspace-composition.md and root acceptance.",
