y this requirement. Hosted61c5c8b Swift6.2.4 now passes fresh Android host Debug/Release/TSan with39ordinary cases each; root verifies579Git-input/log hashes and the downloaded artifact digest. Services passes; overall run fails minimal-feature GlobalView dead-code Clippy after tests pass. Descriptor-only fix atd6c41a0 passes202minimal tests perD/R and4Clippy combinations locally; d6c41a0 hostedVM/Swift/services all pass, including the fresh Swift6.2.4 Android host runner. No native JNI, S4-21, S4-29 Release injection, physical design parity or GA acceptance inferred. JNI/Java stage5 design is root accepted after11declaration/audit commands and81exact bindings; all50native/visual/external implementation cases remain pending. Shared appearance foundation, closed native Swift backend, Java subset, actual JNI/Looper/window observation and signed-core composition remain required; no native or GA authority follows from declarations. Data-only SDK packet encoder and shared pending-frontier repair accepted after158root bindings,51SDKtests perDebug/Release,16productionJava decoder assertions,3public return events, officialiOS/Android modules and independent old/repaired comb/boundary probes. Exact1MiB output is measured before output allocation; count/depth admission precedes child enqueue. Ordinary Android engine adoption, nativeJNI/widgets, signed health, shared appearance and physical parity remain separate; noGA pass. Ordinary Android engines now adopt reviewed packet encoding:9tests perDebug/Release,34Java contract checks,2public engine consumers and officialAPI28AArch64 shared-library link pass. Shared appearance foundation design accepted with46bindings,50shape tests perPython mode and typed declarations; SDK implementation assigned. No native renderer/theme consumption, installed signed capture, physical parity or GA acceptance yet. Private Swift cache candidate3 now accepted within bounded synthetic and named-value accounting scope:823root bindings,18named tests perDebug/Release,21explicit terminal latches and315repeated routes per mode,3actual isolated constructor exhaustion cleanups per mode. Construction57224(+96); other phase bounds unchanged. Executor compiling type/lifetime/layout prerequisite assigned; actual executor/full-target/native/device/immutable consumer/GA qualification pending. Hosted01d8491 all3jobs pass. Pure appearance foundation implementation accepted:66SDKtests permode,5153independent descriptor cases and2507093assertions permode,171root bindings,iOS/officialAndroid module compilation. Eight unchanged iOS simulator references accepted after170artifact bindings/50Git inputs; provisional sharedCandidate1 does not match nav/section/toggle/groupedlist reference yet. Native style/resource/signed/device/GA qualification remains pending. Hosted09dac10 all3pass; d814055 VM/servicespass but Swiftfixed35mspollingtest fails, bounded-wait repair under qualification. Java private descriptor data reader accepted:root7147cases/independent7990cases agree withSwift acrossJava default/interpreted andSwiftD/R;89438independentJavaassertions permode,89rootbindings. NoJava defaulttable/nativeART/rendering/installedauthority. Polling test repair passes48bridge tests perD/R/TSan and controlled old/fixed queue probes inD/R; hostedrecheck pending. Pure shared appearance resolution only: 86 SDK tests plus 29,278 independent cases/350,077 assertions per build mode, 224 root bindings. No native styling, design parity or GA pass; iOS-reference metrics and renderer consumption remain pending. Private executor layout and finalfoundation correction only:2102bindings,350passing/9ignored allfeaturetests/profile. No executoralgorithm or targetexecution, device/release/GA pass. Apple reference measurement accepted within simulator scope:24captures/12D-Rprofiles,385rootbindings; independentImageIO reproduces all24decodedpixelhashes,16historical+12D-Rexactcomparisons. Per-role accessibility/font and component recipe refinement/native consump