gates/ga.json:12172:      "evidence_scope": "Updated product-plan section8.3 requires shared-theme design parity: same layout, hierarchy, content, colors, typography scale, iconography, spacing and component appearance on iOS/Android. Current platform-default controls do not satisfy it. Shared appearance schema and both adapters require coordinated implementation, explicit opt-in for platform-specific app appearance, and side-by-side physical reference-screen review. Native accessibility/navigation/text input and system-owned surfaces remain native. Legitimate text-shaping/rasterization/density/safe-area differences are permitted. Physical design-parity evidence remains pending while phones are disconnected; prior interaction receipts do not qualify this requirement. JNI/Java stage5 design is root accepted after11declaration/audit commands and81exact bindings; all50native/visual/external implementation cases remain pending. Shared appearance foundation, closed native Swift backend, Java subset, actual JNI/Looper/window observation and signed-core composition remain required; no native or GA authority follows from declarations. Ordinary Android engines now adopt reviewed packet encoding:9tests perDebug/Release,34Java contract checks,2public engine consumers and officialAPI28AArch64 shared-library link pass. Shared appearance foundation design accepted with46bindings,50shape tests perPython mode and typed declarations; SDK implementation assigned. No native renderer/theme consumption, installed signed capture, physical parity or GA acceptance yet. Pure shared appearance resolution only: 86 SDK tests plus 29,278 independent cases/350,077 assertions per build mode, 224 root bindings. No native styling, design parity or GA pass; iOS-reference metrics and renderer consumption remain pending. Apple reference measurement accepted within simulator scope:24captures/12D-Rprofiles,385rootbindings; independentImageIO reproduces all24decodedpixelhashes,16historical+12D-Rexactcomparisons. Per-role accessibility/font and component recipe refinement/native consumption/physical parity remain pending. Hosted5988e4a all3jobs pass. No gate status or accountable reviewer acceptance changed. Java appearance resolution has scoped pure-data acceptance (183 root bindings). Twelve native font profiles/contextual candidates have reference-only acceptance (571 bindings; eighteen PNGs byte-identical). Android preference mapping, native measured shared styles and physical parity remain pending. Hosted7c2baeb all three jobs pass; earlierc687e69 TSan timeout remains a recorded failure under investigation, not a gate pass. Shape measurement integrity accepted260bindings with12byte-identicalparentPNGs; authoredpaths retain residuals. SDKsharedtextprofiledata accepted65bindings with89hosttests/profile,72native-reference rolemetrics and3502selectoroutcomes/profile,publiciOS/Androidmodulecompilation. These are data/reference/compilation checks only; native style/input/accessibility and physicaldesignparity remain pending. Android V2 descriptor/geometry host data accepted with 387 bindings and four-mode independent descriptor/geometry boundaries. No renderer adoption, actual resources, native support or physical parity. Swift V2 recipe/style resolution accepted as pure immutable data:654 root bindings,127 SDK tests and133 independent cases per Debug/Release, all6 semantic mutants detected. Android resolver verification and both native drawing primitives underway. Renderer/resource/support/transaction/physical/signed/published FieldLog/GA remain pending. Hosted df97e3f and82d520c all3jobs pass; exact Java-to-DEX supplement is compilation only and predates the resolvers. Closed native V2 path adapters accepted with195rootbindings:131SDKtests perDebug/Release+iOS17compile,5610nativeAndroidAPI37emulatorchecks/45paths/630verbs. ActualCoreGraphics andAndroidPath fill/clip/coordinates/ownership pass; renderers/capture/resources/transactions/physicalparity/signedV2/FieldLog/GA still pending. Android V2 resolver accepted with2143rootbindings:185actualSwift/JVMcases,510724producerassertions/JVMmode;independent23preparations115rejections6279assertions/mode,8semanticmutantsdetected,all72profile/rolepairs. Complete12Javaapplication sources/D8minimumAPI28compile. Puredata only;actualARTresolver/nativecapture/layout/transaction/physical/signed/FieldLog/GA stillpending. Private ordinary staged C forwarding accepted within host execution/API28 compilation scope (77 C assertions per Debug/Release, C++ linking); JNI/native attachment/FieldLog/physical gate evidence remains pending. Private Android shared-style consumer now has headless-only current-source acceptance with885rootbindings; historicalAPI37native460main/14inset/fivenegative checks predate currentSection/baselinefixes and are not currentnativequalification. PrivateJNI and generated C exports pass actualhost585production/199derived assertions eachfourmodes plus generatedSwift tests/officialarm64API28unsignedAPK and missing-export rejection;543rootbindings. No currentnativecoordinator, V2Activityopt-in, signedpresentation, fullresource/support, physical or GA acceptance. Computeruse/screenshots/native simulator/emulator runtime resumed byuser; physicalphones deferred. Private coordinator SDK/DEX/host decision acceptance only:133scenarios/2087checks with test-only leaves. No actualJNI/Swift/nativewindow join, design parity, physical or GA acceptance. Generated private coordinator export now passes exactsource locking, tamperrejects and actualunsignedarm64API28APK withrootDEX/symbolinspection; publicV1unchanged andnativejoinpending. Current API37 candidate16 privateconsumer acceptance supersedes previousnativepending statement forSection/baselinerepairs only:570main+120first+120last+14inset assertions,fiverejectioninstallations,ninecurrentcaptures,exactsource/buildbinding,ownedemulatorstopped. No ordinaryengine/nativejoin,crossplatformparity,physicalorGApass;accountablereviewer remains pending. Latest follow-on slice: The ordinary Swift engine/JNI/private V2 coordinator/native renderer join now has a frozen headless APK build: 105 source inputs, 63 successful build commands, 177 retained compiled artifacts and 10 exact accepted renderer sources. Root headless-review-3 verifies artifact identity and removes its owned extraction after the holder check. Native assertions executed: zero. A separately bound runtime-runner extraction cleanup correction is underway before dispatch. Desktop UI access still awaits Mac unlock; public V1, shared cross-platform parity, physical and GA acceptance remain pending. Latest checkpoint: Ordinary Swift/JNI/private coordinator/native-renderer APK has root headless build acceptance:105inputs/63buildcommands/177compiledartifacts/10renderer matches. Separate runtime cleanup correction passes24host guards and184sealed bindings. Two actual API37 emulator attempts failed before boot with zero APK installations/native assertions; both owned processes/ports and172884977byte extractions cleaned. Read-only crash diagnosis underway before a changed experiment. Apple UI awaits Mac unlock; phones deferred; no publicV2, full native/design parity orGA acceptance. Android boot diagnosis now localizes both failed coordinator attempts to netsim channel startup. A separate root-dispatched API37 arm64 boot-only probe passes with the sole launch delta -feature -WiFiPacketStream; its owned process group and ports are absent after cleanup. Root verifies 102 saved bindings and fifteen host guards. No APK or app assertion ran. A separately bound full runner adaptation is underway; the original APK, sources and assertions remain unchanged. Apple UI still awaits Mac unlock; physical phones and full product gates remain deferred. Checkpoint a1f78d1e passes all three engine CI jobs (VM, Swift and services), with no skipped steps. See verification/github-ci-a1f78d1e-engine/receipt.json. The separately dispatched Android coordinator run boots and installs the exact frozen APK, then stops on check 27 after 26 passes: the fixture incorrectly requires Switch.performClick() to report an OnClickListener. Its original failure and cleanup are retained. A test-only correction preserves the actual reducer revision, checked state and identity assertions for a fresh native run; no app acceptance is claimed yet. Latest observed attempt: The corrected Android instrumentation build preserves production entry bytes and passes 36 fresh root host guards, but its first native attempt fails APK installation: resources.arsc was compressed during repacking. Root verifies 35 retained runtime files and independently confirms stored-to-deflated metadata drift with identical resource bytes. Zero app assertions ran; the owned emulator group, ports and 177-file extraction were cleaned. A separate APK-only packaging correction and pre-install storage/alignment validator are underway. Earlier 26 native passes and fixture failure remain historical evidence, not completed join acceptance. Latest observed native acceptance: The ordinary Swift/JNI/private coordinator/native-renderer join now has root acceptance for its bounded API37 arm64 development subset: all eight operations and 64 native checks pass. Root verifies 56 runtime artifacts/60 bindings and independently decodes seven packets, confirming reducer revisions, checked/text state, retained identity, environment byte equality and fresh relaunch. All 88 native/SDK inputs, including test inputs match the checkout; production artifacts are unchanged. The corrected APK passes storage/alignment/signature checks and 44 fresh runner guards. Owned PID/group 31099, ports and 177-file extraction are cleaned; the unrelated emulator/service remain running. Actual pointer gestures, full IME/accessibility/lifecycle, shared appearance parity, public V2/signed transport, physical phones and GA remain pending. The bounded Android pointer contract now has root acceptance for isolated fixture implementation: 20 tap/hold/drag/cancel/scroll and disabled/current/retired actions, at most 320 injected MotionEvents, passive Activity delivery observations and exact committed revision/state/identity oracles. Direct internal callback counts remain unobserved. Root rechecks 49 sealed contract files, 35 current sources, 60 predecessor bindings and all 88 native/SDK inputs (including test inputs). The new fixture lane preserves production bytes; no gesture run or new native acceptance is claimed.",
gates/ga.json:12179:      "referenceDiagnosticCheckpoint": "The reference-first iOS diagnostic now has accepted source, retained generic compilation and repaired classifier evidence. It starts from the existing plain UIButton and checks focus before one public Tab, preserving the original oracle, targets and timing. All 34 producer and 137 independent host controls pass; root rehashes four frozen handoffs and 79 members. The earlier eight classifier failures and authored-first native failure remain unchanged. No new runtime is selected: an importer binding official results to the fresh selected run, device, method, source and products is still required. Full keyboard, carrier, FieldLog, physical-phone and GA acceptance remain pending. See [the reference diagnostic checkpoint](docs/apple-focus-reference-checkpoint.md).",
gates/ga.json:12181:      "referenceRuntimeV3PreparationCheckpoint": "The reference-first runtime V3 importer is frozen for independent host review. Root verifies 65 handoff members; retained producer controls pass 111/111 and repair controls pass 25/25. The exact old reviewer replay passes 32/33, preserving the agreed malformed-journal fixture failure rather than accepting invalid records. Real composed auxiliary captures now validate; original products, strict oracle and prior failures remain unchanged. No new native run is selected. See docs/apple-focus-reference-runtime-v3.md and verification/apple-focus-reference-runtime-v3-root-review/producer-binding.json.",
gates/ga.json:12182:      "referenceRuntimeV3ReviewCheckpoint": "Independent host review rejects runtime V3 for native dispatch: 34/37 new controls pass and three raw timestamp precision controls fail. Ambient Decimal precision can round a fractional endpoint forward and accept a later baseline. All 111 producer, 25 repair and 25 composed-inventory controls pass; the old malformed-fixture result remains 32/33. Root verifies 313 review members and the 307-input binding. A separate V4 exact-arithmetic repair is now assigned; no new simulator run is selected. See docs/apple-focus-reference-runtime-v3-independent-review.md and verification/apple-focus-reference-runtime-v3-root-review/independent-decision.json.",
gates/ga.json:12183:      "referenceRuntimeV4PreparationCheckpoint": "The exact-timestamp V4 importer is frozen for independent host review. Root verifies all 535 handoff members and 621 prior inputs. Producer reports 111 retained, 25 repair, 37 V3-reviewer, 19 precision controls and eight actual-adapter replay cases passing; the historical malformed-fixture result remains 32/33. Fresh independent review is running, so no V4 native run is selected. Source, products, oracle and prior failures remain unchanged. See docs/apple-focus-reference-runtime-v4.md and verification/apple-focus-reference-runtime-v4-root-review/producer-binding.json.",
gates/ga.json:12184:      "referenceRuntimeV4ReviewCheckpoint": "Independent host review rejects the V4 iOS result importer: 30 of 36 new controls pass and six fail across root timestamp precision, missing archived fixture inputs, Decimal context isolation and incomplete-report schema. Root verifies all 959 review members. A separate V5 repair is running with a closed fixture set and exact canonical timestamps. No new native run is selected. See docs/apple-focus-reference-runtime-v4-independent-review.md and verification/apple-focus-reference-runtime-v4-root-review/independent-decision.json.",
