gates/ga.json:12380:      "evidence_scope": " Private executor layout and finalfoundation correction only:2102bindings,350passing/9ignored allfeaturetests/profile. No executoralgorithm or targetexecution, device/release/GA pass. Root accepts bounded private Uninitialized construction and zero-frame cleanup: 927 bindings, 615 typed classes/5,004 positions, eight layouts; fresh product-only D/R full suites 366 passed with nine ignored each. Earlier contaminated 367-test claims superseded. No shared interpreter, initialized target, physical or GA qualification. Static type/borrow subset only accepted with149bindings; no instruction algorithm or target execution. NarrowFrozenMode numericprimitive dispatch accepted360rootbindings; originalowner validation/work/observe/trap literal, noAPI/ownerfield/formulachange. Selected1572hostexecutions+72explicitNodeoracles,4x454publictraces,independent10semantic+4workboundarychecks/profile pass. Typedmax464within512/fixed2912 unchanged. Fullintegration suite notrerun; broadClippy26sameexistingdiagnostics remainsfailure. Complete numericowner/sharedSwiftoperations/fulltarget/physical/FieldLog/GA remainpending. Private literal Frozen control macro extraction has scoped host acceptance:795 matching rows/configuration,four configurations,44 independently verified binaries,eight root host replays; no Swift control/active-frame/full-runtime/native/GA acceptance. Candidate2 private control source/accounting preflight accepted after7640positive fields,fresh independentMIR/eightlayouts and unchangedFrozenexpansions. SC01-SC12 behavior and liveintegration remainpending; no published target/native/GA gate pass. Private control behavior is now root accepted and integrated at241f7a60:4x46 original/4x6Frozen per producer/reviewer,4x7 independent probes,168/197full libraries perDebug/Release,8layouts; root669bindings and52integratedRelease tests. Full dispatcher/Ready/public/native/FieldLog/GA remainpending. Load/Store compiling type/borrow/logical-accounting prerequisite only:454root bindings,8independent library checks,16paired layouts,39unchanged Frozen methods. MM01-MM16 behavior/caller orchestration remain pending; original absent-cursor Cleanup diagnostic remains and G08 stays open. No integration/native/GA acceptance. Latest isolated behavior review: Isolated memory behavior passes64MM+24independent adversarial selections,16paired layouts,39Frozen methods and56Frozen pairs. Root verifies381review+1451producer bindings. MR01 requires eight separately counted unit promotion fields (64named bytes); isolated correction active. Live VM remains accepted control baseline241f7a60. No full dispatcher/Ready/public/native/GA acceptance; G08 source diagnostic remains open. Checkpointe337ddd1 passes all three engine jobs. Latest correction: Memory promoted correction563bindings/4800positions/64MM+184prior pass; fresh independentreview active, liveunchanged. Latest integrated checkpoint: Private original-owner Load/Store is now independently reviewed, root accepted and integrated. MR01 resolves eight omitted unit promoted positions (64 bytes), retaining all 4,792 prior positions for 4,800 total. Root verifies 1,269 upstream and 22 integration bindings; fresh normalized-source Release runs pass 62 focused tests and 16 Frozen integration tests, plus Swift CI Clippy with warnings denied. Producer64 memory/184 prior selections and reviewer12 focused selections remain separately bound. Integrated123-file closure17f9ea5b93fbc0b5bd51df8484e30e0cbe420eac646730da7d330c4b4ecde9ff. Full dispatch/Ready/public/native/FieldLog/GA and G08 absent-cursor diagnostics remain open. Checkpoint615a05dc passes all three engine CI jobs; no GA acceptance. Latest follow-on slice: The isolated copy/fill/MemorySize candidate is frozen at 125-file closure e5050427a9653019e429bd6cb050133e89617d9a40c9896e0d684f12aa7c8626. Producer evidence passes 312 selected tests across four configurations, 64 Frozen differential pairs, 16 paired layouts and 4,324 newly accounted fields while preserving all 4,800 prior memory rows. Root replay of the sealed producer packet and live baseline passes. Fresh independent source, behavior and accounting review is in progress; this candidate is not integrated. Growth, dispatcher, Ready/public execution, native and GA acceptance remain pending. Latest checkpoint: Shared original-owner copy/fill/MemorySize is now independently reviewed, root accepted and integrated. The reviewed125-file closure e5050427a9653019e429bd6cb050133e89617d9a40c9896e0d684f12aa7c8626 differs from integrated96c945a817c81be17fb526067d87cc667a21cdaf5a47be18179e10fe5ed8de0d only by two explicitly bound blank-line whitespace removals. Root574upstream+23rootbindings pass; fresh normalized-source78focused/16Frozen Release tests, Swift CI Clippy and whitespace pass. Independent76fresh selections,4MIR,4layouts,39Frozenmethods/14owners; producer312selections/64Frozenpairs/16layouts remain separately attributed. All4800memory positions retained plus4324bulk positions. Owned scratch removed. Growth implementation is underway in isolation; full dispatch/Ready/public/native/GA and G08 remain open. Latest isolated growth prerequisite: The private Swift memory.grow slice is independently reviewed and integrated. Root verifies 798 upstream bindings and 31 integration files; the raw reviewed closure is preserved and the integrated 127-file closure a0bbe77aca3021e48f1fb76dc97cfbc0406c24e5ba7eacdd33d5dabe8f998d9b differs only by one removed trailing ASCII space. Fresh normalized-source checks pass 98 focused all-feature Release tests, 16 Frozen Release tests and Swift-only Clippy. Independent review passes 20 exact-source growth tests, 14 adversarial selections, four fresh MIR inventories, sixteen raw layout audits and four representative layout executions. All 10,356 growth, 4,800 memory and 4,324 bulk positions remain accounted; 39 Frozen methods and sixteen checked owner declarations are unchanged. Owned command groups and scratch are cleaned. This accepts private host development only; G08 absent-cursor diagnostics, full dispatch/Ready/public/native/FieldLog/physical/GA remain pending. The private host-import contract has root compiler/layout prerequisite acceptance: 557 root bindings, 14 original source archives, 16 fresh isolated layout contexts, retained exact executables and eight full unit lists. Historical shared-target outputs supply numeric proposals only. An isolated implementation lane is rebasing and remeasuring on accepted growth before qualifying H01\u2013H16 actual imported-host behavior. No host import runtime acceptance is claimed.",
gates/ga.json:12381:      "currentCheckpoint": "The private Swift calls/dispatch candidate at source closure ba9231499244692bbed61f0566ec72864a979df9e3fc71511560ec66a2e00c70 now has independent and root logical-accounting acceptance: 89,124 roles, 1,032 exact finite positions, eight compiler contexts and sixteen layouts. All 39 Frozen methods, the 2,912-byte Frozen bound, original owners and ceilings are preserved. Runtime preflight found three original fixture sums missing the new calls component. The separate V7 candidate at source closure 78e2586b41f698c60e1bcd4cdd4abb33fbf98d747d1ee183a793988dea7b5237 contains only those three expectation additions over V5; all eight implementation files remain unchanged. Fresh compiler evidence, root replay and final independent accounting review pass with all selected runtime MIR bodies unchanged. The sealed 27-command private runtime matrix now passes with 1,378 test executions, all 63 source/compiler and Node prelaunch checks, final Node pins and cleanup. Root accepted it, integrated eleven changed files and passed a fresh 342-test live-path check with the qualified tool environment. The first live check had one runner-PATH failure and remains preserved. Final integrated closure 3dee84f70c852c2a26572c1d6e3463e45e56760a6bba403fabfb9c355ccb1cd3 differs from V7 only by removing spaces on seven otherwise-empty lines after the successful runtime checks; the exact formatting normalization is recorded and git diff --check passes. See verification/swift-calls-dispatch-root-review/sealed-v7/runtime-review.json and live-v7-integration-retry. Prior checkpoint 9a9c0e00 passes all three Engine CI jobs. No native, full Swift readiness, FieldLog, OTA or GA gate is closed by this development slice.",
gates/ga.json:12382:      "lifecycleCheckpoint": "The private Swift lifecycle V3 candidate now has root acceptance for its selected host matrix: all 30 rows pass, comprising 1,602 test executions and four compile checks. The four focused contexts pass 23 lifecycle tests each; Swift and all-feature libraries, Frozen regressions and both qualified Node oracle runs also pass. Root verifies all 978 sealed files and all 30 target cleanups. V2\u2019s failed ticket assertion remains preserved; V3 changes its expectation to match retained decoded-cache ownership without changing engine limits. The exact three-file private implementation is now integrated: the full 132-file VM source closure matches the tested candidate, and 23 focused live tests plus Swift-only Clippy pass. Its fresh target is removed. The complete SL matrix, guest table mutation, real full reactor, native execution, FieldLog and GA remain pending.",
gates/ga.json:12383:      "lifecycleTestCheckpoint": "The private lifecycle test suite is now expanded from 23 to 49 identities and integrated without changing production engine bytes. All four Swift/all Debug/Release contexts pass (196 executions), six compiler-negative checks pass, and independent review passes 49 tests plus two controls over eight variants. Root verifies both packets and passes a fresh 49-test live replay at exact 132-file closure `64a3d9c52ade75ec16de10191f14257fb75ff358c366666cf47809e2b9a7f0de`. All owned build targets are removed. Every SL01-SL23 row remains partial; table mutation, the full reactor, public/signed/native entry, FieldLog and GA remain pending. See docs/swift-reactor-lifecycle-remaining-checkpoint.md.",
gates/ga.json:12384:      "latestLifecycleCI": "Checkpoint `50f70a79` passes the complete Engine CI after the test-only deadline fixture repair: all three jobs and all 38 steps succeed, with none skipped. The Linux VM job passes 391 all-feature tests and 361 Swift-only tests in both Debug and Release; Swift, services and separate Phoenix CI also pass. The earlier `ccd8e4c3` three-test Linux setup failure remains preserved. See `verification/github-ci-50f70a79-engine/receipt.json`, `verification/github-ci-50f70a79-vm/receipt.json` and `verification/github-ci-50f70a79-phoenix/receipt.json`."
