gates/ga.json:12914:      "customerAuthorizationPostgres": "Root accepts the finite durable PostgreSQL lookup and selected fixture/migration integration after verifying 656 retained bindings and 25 current inputs. Final independent CI-fixture and standalone modes each pass the same 25 product methods plus 17 independent probes; all five migrations apply/idempotently rerun and the latest two roll back/reapply. Predefined pg_ role membership now rejects directly and indirectly. Original failed role, rollback and collector-preservation attempts remain intact. Runtime is read-only; scoped FORCE RLS and six canonical revocation locks supply evidence to the existing pure policy. Default adapter remains unavailable. Full standard CI/PostgreSQL 16, actual existing build-worker assertions, trusted-clock before-effect checks, domain/audit/idempotency/Oban transactions, customer HTTP/console and deployed topology/GA remain pending. See docs/hosted-customer-authorization-postgres-review.md and verification/hosted-customer-authorization-postgres-root-acceptance/acceptance.json.",
gates/ga.json:12915:      "postgresAuthorizationDelivery": "Checkpoint d385adf3dd110da44ba290a7221278c48e39b882 is committed and pushed to origin/main; remote main matches. Exactly 802 changed paths include reviewed local PostgreSQL evidence lookup, strict role checks, ordinary CI fixture/migration wiring and rollback repair, audited rejected finite cost/age retention experiment and accurate indices. Live VM and unavailable public authorization default remain unchanged. Phoenix CI 40188545250 passes one job and eight steps; Engine CI 40188545375 passes three jobs and 38 steps; zero skipped steps. Previous cb56d4b9 Phoenix and Engine CI both passed without skipped steps. See verification/github-delivery-postgres-authorization/delivery-receipt.json and verification/github-ci-d385adf3/observation-3/receipt.json. No domain/public/native/provider/GA acceptance.",
gates/ga.json:12916:      "customerAuthorizedTransaction": "Accepted corrected local transaction-owned authorization prerequisite: 18 producer and 21 independent real PostgreSQL methods pass, plus the exact CI fixture and all six migration apply/idempotence/latest-three rollback/reapply checks. Review repaired post-validation deadline checks and reproduced caught local-effect failures that committed SQL; corrected failures latch and roll back. Complete immutable context and current revision snapshots bind owner/Repo/connection/xid/marker/settings/action/target, with fresh server-clock checks and a five-second monotonic deadline. Root verifies 424 retained files and 201 historical source copies; all owned fixture cleanup is complete. New full hosted CI/PG16 remains pending. Protected artifact metadata/storage, immutable actor audit, principal-bound idempotency, lifecycle writers, HTTP/console and deployed/native/GA qualification remain pending.",
gates/ga.json:12918:      "authorizedTransactionDelivery": "Checkpoint 9662eda186e3beee084f92ac25c4116c92f2cebc is committed and pushed to origin/main; remote main matches. Exactly 506 changed paths include reviewed local transaction-owned authorization, effect rollback repair, ordinary CI fixture and six-migration integration, proposed artifact transaction contract and unselected adaptive retention model. Live VM and branded console remain unchanged. Phoenix CI 40190910760 and Engine CI 40190910724 both passed for this exact source: one Phoenix job and three Engine jobs, zero skipped steps. Prior d385adf3 Phoenix and Engine CI both passed without skipped steps. See verification/github-delivery-authorized-transaction/delivery-receipt.json and verification/github-ci-9662eda1/observation-1/receipt.json. No protected domain/customer route/provider/native/GA acceptance.",
gates/ga.json:12919:      "customerArtifactComposition": "Local customer artifact composition accepted after repairs: protected signed upload, staged exact-target private read, v2 actor audit and principal-bound idempotency. Codec: 39 producer and 49 combined independent methods; staged read: 63 producer/regression and 80 combined independent methods; storage: 19 producer and 22 independent methods; facade: 15 producer and 12 independent methods, including actual failed commits for upload/read/audit. Counts overlap. Current-source focused CI passes 97 methods and all seven migrations apply, rerun idempotently, roll back the latest four and reapply. Root verifies 428 retained bindings and 45 current inputs. At artifact checkpoint 6fff5ab9, 132 VM and 40 console bindings were unchanged. All owned PostgreSQL and scratch cleanup passed. Original findings and repairs remain preserved. See docs/hosted-customer-artifact-integration.md and verification/hosted-customer-artifact-root-acceptance/attempt-2/acceptance.json. Customer HTTP/console, tenant trust/lifecycle writers, providers, operations, native, FieldLog and GA remain pending.",
gates/ga.json:12920:      "customerArtifactDelivery": "Artifact checkpoint 6fff5ab981f88d7a92c006d20c36f5e963335a9d is pushed to origin/main and remote main was verified. Exactly 2,198 changed paths contain reviewed local customer artifact composition, ordinary CI fixtures, seven-migration integration and retained evidence. Phoenix CI 40195108526 and Engine CI 40195108524 both pass with no skipped steps. See verification/github-delivery-customer-artifacts/delivery-receipt.json and verification/github-ci-6fff5ab9/observation-7/receipt.json. No customer HTTP, provider, native or GA acceptance.",
gates/ga.json:12923:      "customerArtifactHTTP": "Local customer HTTP accepted: canonical v3 artifact PUT/GET/HEAD and audit GET/HEAD, exact action scope before body, digest-bound signed upload before transaction, exact retained read bytes and schema-2 audit. Facade: 18 producer and 25 combined independent methods. Transport: 32 producer and 46 combined independent methods. Actual Endpoint/Bandit/default verifier with synthetic TLS JWKS and restricted PostgreSQL: eight methods, 47 requests, zero skips. Counts overlap. Encoded/raw-path aliases were independently reproduced, repaired and retested before body/effects. Root verifies 244 retained bindings and 56 current product inputs; all owned listeners/workers/PostgreSQL/scratch cleaned, 32 console-brand and 132 VM bindings unchanged. See docs/hosted-customer-artifact-http-checkpoint.md. Live console sessions/data, production providers, tenant trust/lifecycle writers, distributed admission, legacy audit/full Go parity, native, FieldLog and GA remain pending.",
gates/ga.json:12925:      "customerWorkspace": "Local workspace development slice accepted: identity-only Session and directory-mode isolation; human mixer.workspace.read; SELECT discovery RLS, nullable names, canonical pagination, selected witness/head locks and final commit checks. Real production Endpoint/default verifier/default Repo joins the actual Node console client. Storage passes 24 producer plus 9 independent methods; HTTP passes 22 workspace plus 32 artifact regressions; signed token scope passes 17; real HTTP passes 11 methods covering 65 raw responses plus Node calls; console passes 68 host tests and build, and client independent review passes 21 methods. Counts overlap. Whitespace-ID labels, strict compiler checks and stripped token scope findings are repaired with prior evidence retained. Root acceptance verifies 754 bindings and 98 current product inputs. All owned resources cleaned. The selector follows the website logo/style. App/login/session/browser/CORS/lifecycle/provider/operations/native/FieldLog/GA qualification remains pending. See docs/hosted-customer-workspace-checkpoint.md.",
gates/ga.json:12927:      "customerWorkspaceDelivery": "Workspace checkpoint 9a2bf16b59f98f2e0094ea6820c337ec1ed82c8c is pushed to origin/main and remote main matches. The 1,641 explicit changed paths contain reviewed workspace API/storage, website-branded controlled selector, actual console client, CI wiring and retained evidence. Local acceptance passes; Console CI 40202578691 passes. Phoenix CI 40202578720 failed stale migration expectations and expiry-lock timing fixtures; the real workspace HTTP join passed. Fixture repair awaits next exact-push verification. Engine CI 40202578667 remains running. See verification/github-delivery-customer-workspace/delivery-receipt.json and verification/github-ci-9a2bf16b/observation-4/receipt.json. App/login/session/browser/provider/native/FieldLog/GA qualification remains pending.",
gates/ga.json:12928:      "customerWorkspaceComposition": "Local console workspace composition accepted: actual /workspace route in website-branded shell, one app-owned controller across routes, exact scoped selection/pagination, immutable responses, cancellation and generation fences. Public reactive reads/actions guard live versus admitted session identity, preventing old-account rows before effects run. Header uses actual matched route. Full console100 host tests/build and14 independent probes pass;4 nested binding methods use real Solid client runtime and HTTP client. Counts overlap. Production entry has no session adapter and remains unavailable. Proposed same-origin login contract passes19 design-model controls only; lifecycle/provider/browser/ingress/native/FieldLog/GA pending. See docs/console-workspace-composition.md and root acceptance.",
gates/ga.json:12929:      "workspaceFixtureRepair": "Latest Phoenix failure corrected locally: five setup fixtures now expect all eight migrations and aggregate rollback/reapply includes migration6. Expiry test aligns after actual witness selection and requires observed pre-expiry project-head lock, successful post-expiry lock result and empty RLS reread. All 24 workspace methods and full eight/aggregate five migration controls pass; owned PostgreSQL and scratch removed. Production sources/timeouts unchanged. Five broad fixture suites and held-worker preservation await automatic Linux CI. See docs/hosted-workspace-ci-fixture-repair.md.",
gates/ga.json:12930:      "workspaceCompositionDelivery": "Reviewed console composition and CI fixture corrections pushed as f2aba240ebdecae1c810f50528f0ed4ed6245be1 to origin/main. Explicit 615 changed paths only. Console CI 40204405241 passes. Phoenix CI 40204405232 passes prior migration/expiry repairs but fails 121-project directory transaction deadline (527/528 methods pass, two existing skips); query diagnosis in progress without raising limits. Engine CI 40204405509 VM/services pass, Swift running. Earlier 9a2bf16b Engine CI40202578667 now passes all three jobs. No login/provider/browser/native/FieldLog/GA acceptance.",
