PLAN.md:153:Current delivery addendum: the minimal positive prepared-archive timestamp correction is independently accepted for fresh isolated CI after 129 producer and six independent pure controls; all 126 original test bodies, 1,232 payload entries and 177 product files remain unchanged. Mix 1.20.4 treats a missing target as time zero, so epoch-zero inputs omitted 97 of JOSE's 113 Erlang modules. The prior exact `8888d8e2` network run `40766689512` passed the 895-byte Rebar capture but failed both product methods with `:jose_jwk` unavailable; all three container cleanups passed. Corrected compilation and both product methods remain pending. Source-pair5 now has actual host evidence: 132 Swift Testing SDK tests plus eight XCTest tests, 69 update tests, 31 CLI tests and 30 Python CLI tests passed, including ten source-pair methods. Negative cases use actual rendered children; the positive tool-order sentinel is in process and proves no Android child build. The generated consumer passed four host tests and an iOS simulator-target cross-build with no simulator boot. Engine run `40766689541` still failed the 60-second `context_schema_scalar_reserved_and_lengths` cache-fixture test; five other jobs passed and cleanup completed. Phoenix run `40766689598` passed 697 tests with two skips plus 45 protocol, 24 storage and one migration checks. Architecture run `40768719255` at `dfd0e319` was in progress at the saved 21:05 UTC observation after pure controls and compiler installation; actual full results remain unknown, with two maximum attempts and no retry. FieldLog public `4d17c926` run `40765792113` timed out its `swift-test` command at 480 seconds after pinned SDK resolution, with no observed build completion or test start; failure count is unavailable, all 16 remote groups closed and one SIGTERM was used. Post-test SDK and lock checks were unreached. Its same-pin phase-split diagnostic is under preparation and has not been selected or pushed. The large raw CI review stays local; [published summaries and timestamp selection](verification/github-delivery-positive-timestamp/selection.json) bind its metadata and hashes. Native/UI/capture, disconnected-phone and all local custody/UnitA holds remain; gates stay 8 running, 30 planned, 0 verified.
